Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"redshift__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（列存+按列编码可选压缩）</span><p class=\"snippet\">列式存储，每列可指定压缩编码（AZ64、ZSTD、Delta、RLE 等），COPY 时可自动分析选择。官方文档 AZ64 为 Redshift 自研编码，在数值列上压缩比与解压速度俱佳。官方文档 压缩为表设计的一部分，编码选择不当会显著影响存储与查询性能。社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>列式存储，每列可指定压缩编码（AZ64、ZSTD、Delta、RLE 等），COPY 时可自动分析选择。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>AZ64 为 Redshift 自研编码，在数值列上压缩比与解压速度俱佳。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>压缩为表设计的一部分，编码选择不当会显著影响存储与查询性能。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Columnar with per-column encoding compression). Columnar storage with per-column compression encodings (AZ64, ZSTD, Delta, RLE, etc.); COPY can auto-analyze an…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Columnar with per-column encoding compression).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Columnar storage with per-column compression encodings (AZ64, ZSTD, Delta, RLE, etc.); COPY can auto-analyze and choose. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>AZ64 is Redshift&#x27;s homegrown encoding with strong ratio and decompression speed on numeric columns. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Compression is part of table design; poor encoding choices materially hurt storage and query performance. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（AWS 专属闭源数仓）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Amazon Redshift 是 AWS 专属的云数仓服务，无开源版本，完全绑定 AWS。官方文档 基于 Parallax/Postgres 8 遗留架构，SQL 方言与运维深度绑定 Redshift 平台。社区共识 迁出需重写分布键/排序键设计与 Redshift 特有函数，成本高。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Amazon Redshift 是 AWS 专属的云数仓服务，无开源版本，完全绑定 AWS。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>基于 Parallax/Postgres 8 遗留架构，SQL 方言与运维深度绑定 Redshift 平台。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>迁出需重写分布键/排序键设计与 Redshift 特有函数，成本高。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (AWS-exclusive closed-source warehouse). Amazon Redshift is an AWS-exclusive cloud warehouse service with no open-source edition, fully bound to AWS. (official …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (AWS-exclusive closed-source warehouse).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Amazon Redshift is an AWS-exclusive cloud warehouse service with no open-source edition, fully bound to AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Built on the legacy Parallax/Postgres 8 architecture; SQL dialect and operations bind deeply to the Redshift platform. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Migrating out requires rewriting distribution/sort key design and Redshift-specific functions — costly. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">基于 PG8 的 CBO，EXPLAIN 可用 官方文档。 无 hint 机制，计划干预靠改写 SQL 与表设计 社区共识。 统计信息过期+错误的 distkey/sortkey 是计划劣化的主因 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>基于 PG8 的 CBO，EXPLAIN 可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 hint 机制，计划干预靠改写 SQL 与表设计 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>统计信息过期+错误的 distkey/sortkey 是计划劣化的主因 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (PG8-derived CBO; no hints; stats + distkeys rule). PG8-based CBO with EXPLAIN <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No hint mechanism; steer plans by rewriting SQL and table design…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (PG8-derived CBO; no hints; stats + distkeys rule).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PG8-based CBO with EXPLAIN <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No hint mechanism; steer plans by rewriting SQL and table design <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Stale statistics plus wrong distkey/sortkey are the top plan-degradation causes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">WLM 队列是核心调优点，参数组可调 官方文档。 Automatic Table Optimization、自动 vacuum、并发扩展部分自治 官方文档。 深度调优仍依赖分布键/排序键设计 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>WLM 队列是核心调优点，参数组可调 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Automatic Table Optimization、自动 vacuum、并发扩展部分自治 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>深度调优仍依赖分布键/排序键设计 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (WLM queue tuning; ATO partly autonomous). WLM queues are the core lever; parameter groups tunable <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Automatic Table Optimization, auto vacuum, and…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (WLM queue tuning; ATO partly autonomous).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>WLM queues are the core lever; parameter groups tunable <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Automatic Table Optimization, auto vacuum, and concurrency scaling are partly autonomous <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Deep tuning still hinges on distkey/sortkey design <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">存储层多副本冗余与底层校验由 AWS 内部完成，用户无页校验开关。官方文档 自动备份与快照防的是逻辑损坏，静默位损坏不在用户可观测范围。官方文档 用户侧无校验命令或损坏审计视图。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>存储层多副本冗余与底层校验由 AWS 内部完成，用户无页校验开关。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>自动备份与快照防的是逻辑损坏，静默位损坏不在用户可观测范围。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>用户侧无校验命令或损坏审计视图。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cloud checks; no user controls). Multi-copy storage redundancy and low-level checks are handled internally by AWS; no user page-checksum switch. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cloud checks; no user controls).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multi-copy storage redundancy and low-level checks are handled internally by AWS; no user page-checksum switch. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Automatic backups and snapshots guard against logical corruption; silent bit-rot is outside user observability. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No user-facing verification command or corruption audit view. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（存储过程（PL/pgSQL 子集）</span><p class=\"snippet\">支持存储过程（PL/pgSQL 子集），游标/异常处理有限 官方文档。 与 PG/Oracle 过程语言差异大，迁移需改写 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>支持存储过程（PL/pgSQL 子集），游标/异常处理有限 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>与 PG/Oracle 过程语言差异大，迁移需改写 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Procedures (PL/pgSQL subset)). Stored procedures (PL/pgSQL subset) with limited cursors/exceptions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Differs a lot from PG/Oracle; migrations ne…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Procedures (PL/pgSQL subset)).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stored procedures (PL/pgSQL subset) with limited cursors/exceptions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Differs a lot from PG/Oracle; migrations need rewrites <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">主键/外键/唯一为信息性约束，不强制执行 官方文档。 用于查询优化，错误声明误导优化器 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>主键/外键/唯一为信息性约束，不强制执行 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>用于查询优化，错误声明误导优化器 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Informational PK/FK/UNIQUE). PK/FK/UNIQUE informational, not enforced <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Used for optimization; wrong declarations mislead the planner (community t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Informational PK/FK/UNIQUE).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PK/FK/UNIQUE informational, not enforced <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Used for optimization; wrong declarations mislead the planner <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">窗口函数、GROUPING SETS 等分析 SQL 完备 官方文档。 基于 PG 8 系，部分新语法缺失 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>窗口函数、GROUPING SETS 等分析 SQL 完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>基于 PG 8 系，部分新语法缺失 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Complete windows/GROUPING SETS). Complete window functions, GROUPING SETS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PG 8-based; some newer syntax missing <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Complete windows/GROUPING SETS).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete window functions, GROUPING SETS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>PG 8-based; some newer syntax missing <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">删除靠标准 DML，无原生擦除工作流或证明 官方文档 自动 / 手动快照保留被删数据的历史状态，需管理快照保留期 官方文档 Redshift Serverless 的快照与恢复点同样构成残留面 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>删除靠标准 DML，无原生擦除工作流或证明 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>自动 / 手动快照保留被删数据的历史状态，需管理快照保留期 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Redshift Serverless 的快照与恢复点同样构成残留面 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (DML deletes; snapshot residue). Deletion is standard DML; no native erasure workflow or attestation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Automated / manual snapshots retain historica…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (DML deletes; snapshot residue).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deletion is standard DML; no native erasure workflow or attestation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Automated / manual snapshots retain historical states of deleted data; snapshot retention must be managed <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Redshift Serverless snapshots and recovery points form the same residue surface <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">表元数据可进 Glue Data Catalog 官方文档。 列级血缘靠 Atlan/Alation 等第三方 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>表元数据可进 Glue Data Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>列级血缘靠 Atlan/Alation 等第三方 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Glue Catalog integration; third-party lineage). Table metadata can flow into Glue Data Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Column-level lineage via third parties like Atlan…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Glue Catalog integration; third-party lineage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Table metadata can flow into Glue Data Catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Column-level lineage via third parties like Atlan/Alation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">自动快照（保留期可配）+ 手动快照；可从快照恢复整个集群或恢复到某个时间点 官方文档。 快照可复制到其他区域做异地容灾；RA3 架构下恢复主要是重建计算节点（数据已在托管存储/S3 侧），比 DC2 时代快 官方文档。 Redshift Serverless 有自动恢复点，无需手动管快照 官方文档。 注意：快照存储按量计费，保留期设得过长…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>自动快照（保留期可配）+ 手动快照；可从快照恢复整个集群或恢复到某个时间点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>快照可复制到其他区域做异地容灾；RA3 架构下恢复主要是重建计算节点（数据已在托管存储/S3 侧），比 DC2 时代快 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Redshift Serverless 有自动恢复点，无需手动管快照 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：快照存储按量计费，保留期设得过长会变成隐形账单；恢复演练要定期做，不要等到真出事 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (automated snapshots + cross-region copy + point-in-time restore). Automated snapshots (configurable retention) plus manual snapshots; restore a whole cluster o…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (automated snapshots + cross-region copy + point-in-time restore).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Automated snapshots (configurable retention) plus manual snapshots; restore a whole cluster or to a point in time <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Snapshots can be copied to other regions for DR; under RA3, recovery is mostly about rebuilding compute nodes (data already sits in managed storage), faster than the DC2 era <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Redshift Serverless keeps automatic recovery points — no manual snapshot management <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: snapshot storage is metered — over-long retention becomes a stealth line item; rehearse restores regularly, not during a real incident <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">RA3 节点+Redshift Managed Storage：存算分离 官方文档。 DC2 节点本地 SSD：存算一体 官方文档。 选型时节点类型决定架构范式 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>RA3 节点+Redshift Managed Storage：存算分离 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DC2 节点本地 SSD：存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>选型时节点类型决定架构范式 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (RA3+RMS disaggregated; DC2 coupled). RA3 nodes + Redshift Managed Storage: disaggregated <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. DC2 nodes with local SSDs: coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. N…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (RA3+RMS disaggregated; DC2 coupled).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RA3 nodes + Redshift Managed Storage: disaggregated <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DC2 nodes with local SSDs: coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Node type decides the architecture paradigm <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">SUPER 类型支持半结构化（JSON/Parquet）官方文档。 无原生向量、全文、图能力 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SUPER 类型支持半结构化（JSON/Parquet）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生向量、全文、图能力 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (SUPER semi-structured; no vector/FTS/graph). SUPER type for semi-structured (JSON/Parquet) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native vector, full-text, or graph <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (SUPER semi-structured; no vector/FTS/graph).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SUPER type for semi-structured (JSON/Parquet) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native vector, full-text, or graph <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Serverless 按 RPU（Redshift 处理单元）计量；预置集群 RA3 按节点与托管存储计费。官方文档 成本分配标签 + Cost Explorer + AWS Budgets，归因与告警链路完整。官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Serverless 按 RPU（Redshift 处理单元）计量；预置集群 RA3 按节点与托管存储计费。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>成本分配标签 + Cost Explorer + AWS Budgets，归因与告警链路完整。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (RPU metering; tag attribution). Serverless is metered in RPUs (Redshift Processing Units); provisioned RA3 clusters bill by node and managed storage. (official…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (RPU metering; tag attribution).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Serverless is metered in RPUs (Redshift Processing Units); provisioned RA3 clusters bill by node and managed storage. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Cost allocation tags plus Cost Explorer plus AWS Budgets give a complete attribution and alerting chain. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方 JDBC/ODBC 驱动，redshift-connector（Python）官方文档。 PG 驱动部分兼容但有差异，不建议混用 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>官方 JDBC/ODBC 驱动，redshift-connector（Python）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>PG 驱动部分兼容但有差异，不建议混用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Official JDBC/ODBC + Python connector). Official JDBC/ODBC drivers and redshift-connector (Python) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PG drivers are partly compatible but differ…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Official JDBC/ODBC + Python connector).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official JDBC/ODBC drivers and redshift-connector (Python) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>PG drivers are partly compatible but differ; mixing not advised <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（自动增量刷新+自动改写）</span><p class=\"snippet\">物化视图自动增量刷新、查询自动改写 官方文档。 仅支持部分增量场景，基表大变更回退全量 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>物化视图自动增量刷新、查询自动改写 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>仅支持部分增量场景，基表大变更回退全量 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Auto incremental refresh + rewrite). Automatic incremental refresh and query rewrite <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Only some incremental cases; big base changes fall back t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Auto incremental refresh + rewrite).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Automatic incremental refresh and query rewrite <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Only some incremental cases; big base changes fall back to full <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（AWS 绑定，无跨云）</span><p class=\"snippet\">仅 AWS，无其他云版本 官方文档。 迁出靠 unload 到 S3 + 重建，无跨云复制 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>仅 AWS，无其他云版本 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>迁出靠 unload 到 S3 + 重建，无跨云复制 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (AWS-bound; no cross-cloud). AWS-only; no other-cloud offering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Moving out via UNLOAD to S3 + rebuild; no cross-cloud replication (community…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (AWS-bound; no cross-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS-only; no other-cloud offering <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Moving out via UNLOAD to S3 + rebuild; no cross-cloud replication <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（表级写锁排队，热点写入串行执行）</span><p class=\"snippet\">并发原语是表级写锁叠加隔离级别：新集群默认快照隔离（2024-05-22 起），老集群多为可串行化；无行锁 社区共识。 同表并发写时后来者等待前者释放写锁后继续（排队而非 abort）；可串行化模式下无法映射为串行顺序的事务会被回滚并报 1023 错误，重试由应用负责 官方文档。 表锁即热点瓶颈：同一行的高频 UPDATE 全部串行排队；…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>并发原语是表级写锁叠加隔离级别：新集群默认快照隔离（2024-05-22 起），老集群多为可串行化；无行锁 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>同表并发写时后来者等待前者释放写锁后继续（排队而非 abort）；可串行化模式下无法映射为串行顺序的事务会被回滚并报 1023 错误，重试由应用负责 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>表锁即热点瓶颈：同一行的高频 UPDATE 全部串行排队；INSERT/COPY 的共享锁与 UPDATE 所需的排他锁混用还会导致死锁，官方文档要求应用加重试逻辑 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>未找到官方命名或文档化的热点行机制的证据，热点应对靠应用层 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>推荐模式：按表串行化写入作业、事务内按固定顺序 LOCK 表、微批 COPY 替代逐行更新；代价是并发度归零、串行化窗口拉长，以及 UPDATE 实为删+插导致的块膨胀与 VACUUM 成本 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (table-level write locks queue hotspot writes into serial execution). The concurrency primitive is table-level write locks combined with the isolation…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (table-level write locks queue hotspot writes into serial execution).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The concurrency primitive is table-level write locks combined with the isolation level: new clusters default to snapshot isolation (since 2024-05-22), older ones mostly serializable; there are no row locks <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Concurrent writers on the same table wait for the earlier one to release the write lock, then proceed (queueing, not abort); under serializable mode, a transaction that cannot map to a serial order is rolled back with error 1023, and retrying is the application&#x27;s job <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The table lock is the hotspot bottleneck: high-frequency UPDATEs on the same row all queue serially; mixing the shared locks of INSERT/COPY with the exclusive lock an UPDATE needs can also deadlock, and the official docs require applications to add retry logic <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>There is no officially named or documented hotspot-row mechanism found — hotspot handling is left to the application layer (to be verified).</li>\n<li>Recommended patterns: serialize write jobs per table, LOCK tables in a fixed order inside transactions, and micro-batch COPY instead of row-by-row updates; the cost is concurrency dropping to zero, longer serialization windows, and block bloat from UPDATE being delete-plus-insert plus the resulting VACUUM cost <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">SYS/SVL/STL 三代系统视图：查查询历史、执行计划、WLM 队列等待、锁等待、表倾斜，一应俱全 官方文档。 CloudWatch 指标：CPU、磁盘、查询延迟、并发数；可配告警 官方文档。 SYS_QUERY_HISTORY 支持按 query_label 打标，是做成本归因（哪个业务烧的 RPU）的主入口 社区共识。 边缘：系统…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SYS/SVL/STL 三代系统视图：查查询历史、执行计划、WLM 队列等待、锁等待、表倾斜，一应俱全 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>CloudWatch 指标：CPU、磁盘、查询延迟、并发数；可配告警 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>SYS_QUERY_HISTORY 支持按 query_label 打标，是做成本归因（哪个业务烧的 RPU）的主入口 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘：系统视图本身查询也有成本意识问题——高频轮询 STL 大表在繁忙集群上会加重负担 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (system views + CloudWatch). Three generations of system views (SYS/SVL/STL): query history, execution plans, WLM queue waits, lock waits, table skew — the full…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (system views + CloudWatch).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Three generations of system views (SYS/SVL/STL): query history, execution plans, WLM queue waits, lock waits, table skew — the full DBA toolkit <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>CloudWatch metrics (CPU, disk, query latency, concurrency) with alarming <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li><code>SYS_QUERY_HISTORY</code> with <code>query_label</code> tagging is the main cost-attribution surface (&quot;which business burned the RPUs&quot;) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Edge: the system views themselves need cost awareness — high-frequency polling of big STL tables on a busy cluster adds load <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">标准 JDBC/ODBC，BI 工具直连无门槛；psql 可连（方言兼容层）官方文档。 Redshift Data API：HTTPS 接口，无需维护长连接池，适合 Lambda/无服务器应用与 CI 任务 官方文档。 网络：VPC 部署，支持 VPC 终端私有访问；查询编辑器 v2 浏览器直查 官方文档。 注意：预置集群有并发连接上限与…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>标准 JDBC/ODBC，BI 工具直连无门槛；psql 可连（方言兼容层）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Redshift Data API：HTTPS 接口，无需维护长连接池，适合 Lambda/无服务器应用与 CI 任务 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>网络：VPC 部署，支持 VPC 终端私有访问；查询编辑器 v2 浏览器直查 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：预置集群有并发连接上限与 WLM 队列，高并发小查询场景要规划队列；Serverless 在弹性上更省心 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (JDBC/ODBC + Data API + private endpoints). Standard JDBC/ODBC — BI tools connect with zero friction; psql works through the dialect-compatibility layer (offici…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (JDBC/ODBC + Data API + private endpoints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Standard JDBC/ODBC — BI tools connect with zero friction; psql works through the dialect-compatibility layer <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Redshift Data API: HTTPS interface with no persistent connection pool to maintain — ideal for Lambda/serverless apps and CI jobs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Networking: VPC deployment with VPC-endpoint private access; Query Editor v2 for browser-based querying <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: provisioned clusters have concurrency/connection limits managed by WLM queues — plan queues for high-concurrency small-query workloads; Serverless is more carefree here <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（ACID，可串行化语义）</span><p class=\"snippet\">支持完整 ACID 事务；Redshift 的事务隔离语义为可串行化（serializable）官方文档。 ETL 标准姿势是&quot;事务包裹批量写&quot;，保证一批次要么全进要么全回滚 社区共识。 注意：长事务持有表锁会阻塞 VACUUM 与 DDL，是生产常见故障根因；这是分析型事务，不是 OLTP 行级锁语义，高频小事务写入性能差 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>支持完整 ACID 事务；Redshift 的事务隔离语义为可串行化（serializable）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>ETL 标准姿势是&quot;事务包裹批量写&quot;，保证一批次要么全进要么全回滚 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：长事务持有表锁会阻塞 VACUUM 与 DDL，是生产常见故障根因；这是分析型事务，不是 OLTP 行级锁语义，高频小事务写入性能差 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (ACID, serializable semantics). Full ACID transactions; Redshift&#x27;s isolation semantics are serializable <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The standard ETL posture is &quot;wrap the b…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (ACID, serializable semantics).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Full ACID transactions; Redshift&#x27;s isolation semantics are serializable <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The standard ETL posture is &quot;wrap the batch write in a transaction&quot; so a batch lands atomically <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: long transactions hold table locks that block VACUUM and DDL — a classic production failure root cause; these are analytical transactions, not OLTP row-lock semantics, and high-frequency tiny writes perform poorly <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">数据共享（Data Sharing）：生产者集群的实时数据可被多个消费者集群/账号直接查询，无需复制数据，是&quot;一份数据多团队用&quot;的主方案 官方文档。 RA3 支持跨 AZ 集群重定位（Cluster Relocation）：AZ 故障时自动把计算节点搬到健康 AZ，数据在托管存储侧不受影响 官方文档。 无内置跨区主动-主动写：多 Regi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>数据共享（Data Sharing）：生产者集群的实时数据可被多个消费者集群/账号直接查询，无需复制数据，是&quot;一份数据多团队用&quot;的主方案 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RA3 支持跨 AZ 集群重定位（Cluster Relocation）：AZ 故障时自动把计算节点搬到健康 AZ，数据在托管存储侧不受影响 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无内置跨区主动-主动写：多 Region 写入要靠快照复制 + 应用层设计，一致性窗口分钟级 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (data sharing + cross-AZ relocation; no cross-region active-active writes). Data Sharing: live data on a producer cluster is directly queryable by multiple cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (data sharing + cross-AZ relocation; no cross-region active-active writes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data Sharing: live data on a producer cluster is directly queryable by multiple consumer clusters/accounts with zero copying — the standard &quot;one dataset, many teams&quot; pattern <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RA3 cross-AZ cluster relocation: on AZ failure, compute nodes are automatically moved to a healthy AZ while data in managed storage is unaffected <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No built-in cross-region active-active writes: multi-region writers need snapshot copies plus application-layer design, with minute-level consistency windows <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "redshift__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">RA3：计算节点数与托管存储容量独立扩展——数据涨到 PB 级不用加节点，只为性能加节点 官方文档。 Redshift Serverless：8–512 RPU 自动扩缩，按秒计费（60 秒起步），负载波动场景免容量规划 官方文档。 并发扩展（Concurrency Scaling）：突发读查询自动拉起临时集群分担，按秒计费，适合报表高峰…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>RA3：计算节点数与托管存储容量独立扩展——数据涨到 PB 级不用加节点，只为性能加节点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Redshift Serverless：8–512 RPU 自动扩缩，按秒计费（60 秒起步），负载波动场景免容量规划 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>并发扩展（Concurrency Scaling）：突发读查询自动拉起临时集群分担，按秒计费，适合报表高峰 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘真相：预置集群的节点增减仍是分钟级操作且要计划窗口；Serverless 有 RPU 下限常驻成本，&quot;弹性&quot;不等于&quot;零待机费用&quot;；并发扩展的账单如果不设上限，毛刺查询可能烧出惊喜 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (RA3 storage-compute separation + Serverless elasticity + concurrency scaling). RA3: compute node count scales independently of managed-storage capacity — grow …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (RA3 storage-compute separation + Serverless elasticity + concurrency scaling).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RA3: compute node count scales independently of managed-storage capacity — grow to PB without adding nodes; add nodes only for performance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Redshift Serverless: 8–512 RPU auto-scaling, billed per second (60-second minimum), no capacity planning for spiky workloads <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Concurrency Scaling: burst read queries automatically get temporary clusters, billed per second — built for reporting peaks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Edge truth: provisioned-cluster resizing is still a minutes-long planned operation; Serverless has a baseline RPU floor (&quot;elastic&quot; ≠ &quot;zero standby cost&quot;); uncapped concurrency scaling can turn a query spike into a billing surprise <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">全量静态加密：所有微分区数据默认 AES-256 加密，密钥由 Snowflake 管理，用户无感 官方文档。 Business Critical 版支持 Tri-Secret Secure：客户自管密钥（CMK/HSM），满足金融/医疗强合规 官方文档。 密钥轮换与层级由平台负责，用户侧无&quot;丢密钥即丢数据&quot;的自运维风险（代价是密钥完全不…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>全量静态加密：所有微分区数据默认 AES-256 加密，密钥由 Snowflake 管理，用户无感 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Business Critical 版支持 Tri-Secret Secure：客户自管密钥（CMK/HSM），满足金融/医疗强合规 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>密钥轮换与层级由平台负责，用户侧无&quot;丢密钥即丢数据&quot;的自运维风险（代价是密钥完全不在自己手里） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">All micro-partition data encrypted at rest with AES-256 by default, keys managed by Snowflake, transparent to users official docs. Business Critical edition supports Tri-…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>All micro-partition data encrypted at rest with AES-256 by default, keys managed by Snowflake, transparent to users <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Business Critical edition supports Tri-Secret Secure: customer-managed keys (CMK/HSM) for strong finance/healthcare compliance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Key rotation and hierarchy handled by the platform — no &quot;lose the key, lose the data&quot; self-hosting risk on your side (at the cost of keys never being in your hands) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">全链路 TLS 1.2+ 加密（客户端—云服务层—仓库—存储） 官方文档。 Business Critical 版支持 AWS PrivateLink / Azure Private Link 私有连接，流量不走公网 官方文档。 无自建证书管理负担（SaaS 托管），但也意味着无法自定义 TLS 策略细节 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>全链路 TLS 1.2+ 加密（客户端—云服务层—仓库—存储） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Business Critical 版支持 AWS PrivateLink / Azure Private Link 私有连接，流量不走公网 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无自建证书管理负担（SaaS 托管），但也意味着无法自定义 TLS 策略细节 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">TLS 1.2+ across the full path (client → cloud services → warehouse → storage) official docs. Business Critical edition supports AWS PrivateLink / Azure Private Link so tr…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>TLS 1.2+ across the full path (client → cloud services → warehouse → storage) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Business Critical edition supports AWS PrivateLink / Azure Private Link so traffic never traverses the public internet <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No self-managed certificate burden (SaaS-hosted), but also no ability to customize TLS policy details <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Snowflake SQL：ANSI 兼容方言，窗口函数、CTE、QUALIFY 等分析语法完整 官方文档。 半结构化 VARIANT/OBJECT/ARRAY 一等公民，JSON 点号访问、FLATTEN 展开 官方文档。 无 PostgreSQL/MySQL wire 协议兼容；专有函数与 DDL 多，从传统数仓/ PG 迁移需改写 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Snowflake SQL：ANSI 兼容方言，窗口函数、CTE、QUALIFY 等分析语法完整 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>半结构化 VARIANT/OBJECT/ARRAY 一等公民，JSON 点号访问、FLATTEN 展开 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 PostgreSQL/MySQL wire 协议兼容；专有函数与 DDL 多，从传统数仓/ PG 迁移需改写 SQL <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Snowflake SQL: ANSI-compatible dialect with full analytical syntax (window functions, CTEs, QUALIFY) official docs. Semi-structured VARIANT/OBJECT/ARRAY are first-class: …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Snowflake SQL: ANSI-compatible dialect with full analytical syntax (window functions, CTEs, QUALIFY) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Semi-structured VARIANT/OBJECT/ARRAY are first-class: dot-notation JSON access, FLATTEN for nested data <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No PostgreSQL/MySQL wire-protocol compatibility; many proprietary functions and DDL — migrating from traditional warehouses or PG requires SQL rewrites <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">闭源 SaaS</span><p class=\"snippet\">闭源商业软件，纯 SaaS，无开源内核、无私有化授权 厂商口径。 四档：Standard → Enterprise → Business Critical → VPS，严格超集（Time Travel 天数、多集群仓库、物化视图、脱敏、HIPAA/PCI、私有连接等逐档解锁） 官方文档。 计费：credit 消费制（约 $2–4/cred…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>闭源商业软件，纯 SaaS，无开源内核、无私有化授权 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>四档：Standard → Enterprise → Business Critical → VPS，严格超集（Time Travel 天数、多集群仓库、物化视图、脱敏、HIPAA/PCI、私有连接等逐档解锁） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计费：credit 消费制（约 $2–4/credit，随版本与区域浮动），计算与存储分离计费，另有容量预购折扣；具体价格易变，本档案不写绝对价格 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Closed-source SaaS</span><p class=\"snippet\">Closed-source commercial software, pure SaaS; no open-source kernel, no self-hosting license vendor claim. Four editions in strict superset order: Standard → Enterprise →…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Closed-source commercial software, pure SaaS; no open-source kernel, no self-hosting license <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Four editions in strict superset order: Standard → Enterprise → Business Critical → VPS (Time Travel days, multi-cluster warehouses, materialized views, masking, HIPAA/PCI, private connectivity unlock per tier) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Billing: credit consumption (~$2–4/credit varying by edition and region), compute and storage billed separately, plus capacity pre-purchase discounts; prices change often, so this profile cites no absolute prices <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方文档以英文为主，中文官方资料少；中文社区靠 CSDN/博客/数据工程手册类翻译与教程 社区共识。 新特性（Cortex、Dynamic Tables、Iceberg 全支持）中文内容滞后明显，查参数与版本边界以英文官方文档为准 社区共识。 国内直接使用受网络与合规限制，中文实践案例少于 AWS/阿里云数仓 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>官方文档以英文为主，中文官方资料少；中文社区靠 CSDN/博客/数据工程手册类翻译与教程 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>新特性（Cortex、Dynamic Tables、Iceberg 全支持）中文内容滞后明显，查参数与版本边界以英文官方文档为准 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>国内直接使用受网络与合规限制，中文实践案例少于 AWS/阿里云数仓 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Official documentation is English-first with little official Chinese material; Chinese community relies on CSDN/blog translations and data-engineering handbook-style tuto…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Official documentation is English-first with little official Chinese material; Chinese community relies on CSDN/blog translations and data-engineering handbook-style tutorials <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Chinese content lags badly on new features (Cortex, Dynamic Tables, full Iceberg support) — check parameters and version boundaries against English official docs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Direct use from mainland China is constrained by network and compliance; fewer Chinese production case studies than AWS/Alibaba warehouses <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">列存微分区 + 自动聚簇（Automatic Clustering），TB 级宽表聚合秒级返回；官方口径 Gen-2 仓库同等 credit 约 2.1x 性价比 厂商口径。 两级缓存：结果缓存（24h 精确匹配零 credit）+ 仓库本地 SSD 缓存（运行期间跨查询有效） 官方文档。 代价：60 秒计费下限使小查询偏贵；自动聚簇烧 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>列存微分区 + 自动聚簇（Automatic Clustering），TB 级宽表聚合秒级返回；官方口径 Gen-2 仓库同等 credit 约 2.1x 性价比 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>两级缓存：结果缓存（24h 精确匹配零 credit）+ 仓库本地 SSD 缓存（运行期间跨查询有效） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>代价：60 秒计费下限使小查询偏贵；自动聚簇烧 credit（需监控）；冷启动（仓库 resume）有秒级延迟 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>点查/高频小写入不是设计目标，延迟与成本均不如 OLTP 或实时 OLAP 引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Columnar micro-partitions + automatic clustering: TB-scale wide-table aggregations return in seconds; vendor claims Gen-2 warehouses deliver ~2.1x perf-per-dollar vendor …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Columnar micro-partitions + automatic clustering: TB-scale wide-table aggregations return in seconds; vendor claims Gen-2 warehouses deliver ~2.1x perf-per-dollar <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Two-level caching: result cache (24h exact match, zero credits) + warehouse-local SSD cache (effective across queries while the warehouse runs) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Costs: the 60-second billing minimum makes small queries expensive; automatic clustering burns credits (must be monitored); cold start (warehouse resume) adds seconds of latency <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n<li>Point lookups / high-frequency small writes are not the design target — worse latency and cost than OLTP or real-time OLAP engines <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">SOC 1/2 Type II、ISO 27001、PCI DSS、GDPR、HITRUST；HIPAA 与客户管密钥（Tri-Secret）需 Business Critical 版 厂商口径。 FedRAMP Moderate（政府版）；注意：FedRAMP High 暂无，要求 FedRAMP High / DoD IL4+ 的联邦…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SOC 1/2 Type II、ISO 27001、PCI DSS、GDPR、HITRUST；HIPAA 与客户管密钥（Tri-Secret）需 Business Critical 版 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>FedRAMP Moderate（政府版）；注意：FedRAMP High 暂无，要求 FedRAMP High / DoD IL4+ 的联邦场景存在合规天花板 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无信创名录公开信息；国内合规落地依赖出海/海外业务场景 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">SOC 1/2 Type II, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, GDPR, HITRUST; HIPAA and customer-managed keys (Tri-Secret) require Business Critical vendor claim. FedRAMP Moderate (government edit…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SOC 1/2 Type II, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, GDPR, HITRUST; HIPAA and customer-managed keys (Tri-Secret) require Business Critical <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>FedRAMP Moderate (government edition); note: no FedRAMP High yet — a compliance ceiling for federal scenarios requiring FedRAMP High / DoD IL4+ <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No public information on Chinese &quot;XinChuang&quot; catalog listings; China compliance落地 depends on overseas-business scenarios <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">2012 年成立，2020 年 NYSE 上市（SNOW），云数仓品类定义者之一 社区共识。 迭代快：Gen-2 仓库、Cortex AI、Dynamic Tables、Iceberg 全支持、Horizon Catalog 两年内密集 GA 厂商口径。 合作伙伴/集成生态大（dbt、Fivetran、BI 全家桶），但开源社区属性弱于 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>2012 年成立，2020 年 NYSE 上市（SNOW），云数仓品类定义者之一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>迭代快：Gen-2 仓库、Cortex AI、Dynamic Tables、Iceberg 全支持、Horizon Catalog 两年内密集 GA <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>合作伙伴/集成生态大（dbt、Fivetran、BI 全家桶），但开源社区属性弱于 Spark/Trino 系（闭源 SaaS 必然） <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Founded 2012, NYSE IPO 2020 (SNOW); one of the definers of the cloud data warehouse category community consensus. Fast iteration: Gen-2 warehouses, Cortex AI, Dynamic Tab…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Founded 2012, NYSE IPO 2020 (SNOW); one of the definers of the cloud data warehouse category <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Fast iteration: Gen-2 warehouses, Cortex AI, Dynamic Tables, full Iceberg support, Horizon Catalog all GA&#x27;d within about two years <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Large partner/integration ecosystem (dbt, Fivetran, the full BI family), but weaker open-source community character than Spark/Trino (inevitable for closed SaaS) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（互联网/金融多行业）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Datadog、Stripe、Cloudflare、Okta 等被社区广泛引用的重度用户 社区共识。 金融（Capital One 类）、零售、医疗、媒体多行业公开案例；Marketplace 数据交易是特色采用场景 社区共识。 具体客户名单以官方客户页为准，本档案不逐一枚举 待验证。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Datadog、Stripe、Cloudflare、Okta 等被社区广泛引用的重度用户 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>金融（Capital One 类）、零售、医疗、媒体多行业公开案例；Marketplace 数据交易是特色采用场景 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>具体客户名单以官方客户页为准，本档案不逐一枚举 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Datadog, Stripe, Cloudflare, Okta are widely cited heavy users in the community community consensus. Public cases across finance, retail, healthcare, and media; Marketpla…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Datadog, Stripe, Cloudflare, Okta are widely cited heavy users in the community <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Public cases across finance, retail, healthcare, and media; Marketplace data trading is a signature adoption pattern <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Customer lists change; refer to the official customers page — this profile doesn&#x27;t enumerate them one by one <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">建模与转换：dbt（Snowflake 是 dbt 最成熟适配之一） 社区共识。 集成与 ELT：Fivetran、Airbyte、Kafka Connector、Openflow（NiFi 系） 官方文档。 IaC 与开发：Terraform Provider、VS Code 插件、Snowflake CLI；BI：Tableau/Po…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>建模与转换：dbt（Snowflake 是 dbt 最成熟适配之一） <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>集成与 ELT：Fivetran、Airbyte、Kafka Connector、Openflow（NiFi 系） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>IaC 与开发：Terraform Provider、VS Code 插件、Snowflake CLI；BI：Tableau/Power BI/Looker/Sigma 原生连接 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：深度 FinOps/成本归因靠第三方工具（官方用量视图偏粗） <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Modeling &amp; transformation: dbt (one of the most mature dbt adapters is dbt-snowflake) community consensus. Integration &amp; ELT: Fivetran, Airbyte, Kafka Connector, Openflow…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Modeling &amp; transformation: dbt (one of the most mature dbt adapters is dbt-snowflake) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Integration &amp; ELT: Fivetran, Airbyte, Kafka Connector, Openflow (NiFi-based) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>IaC &amp; dev: Terraform provider, VS Code extension, Snowflake CLI; BI: native connectors for Tableau/Power BI/Looker/Sigma <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: deep FinOps/cost-attribution relies on third-party tools (official usage views are coarse) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">AWS/Azure/GCP 三朵云全托管，同一产品同一 SQL，跨云复制可用 官方文档。 Serverless：Snowpipe、Tasks（无仓库模式）、Dynamic Tables 增量刷新按实际消耗计费 官方文档。 硬边界：无 on-prem/私有云/专有云选项，数据必须落公有云（或政府版专区）；这是选型一票否决项 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>AWS/Azure/GCP 三朵云全托管，同一产品同一 SQL，跨云复制可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless：Snowpipe、Tasks（无仓库模式）、Dynamic Tables 增量刷新按实际消耗计费 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>硬边界：无 on-prem/私有云/专有云选项，数据必须落公有云（或政府版专区）；这是选型一票否决项 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Fully managed on AWS/Azure/GCP — same product, same SQL, cross-cloud replication available official docs. Serverless: Snowpipe, serverless Tasks, Dynamic Table incrementa…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Fully managed on AWS/Azure/GCP — same product, same SQL, cross-cloud replication available <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless: Snowpipe, serverless Tasks, Dynamic Table incremental refreshes billed on actual consumption <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Hard boundary: no on-prem / private-cloud / sovereign-cloud option — data must land on public cloud (or the government enclave). A one-vote veto item for selection <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（批量/连续/流式三档）</span><p class=\"snippet\">批量：COPY INTO 从 Stage（内部/外部 S3/ADLS/GCS）加载，CSV/JSON/Parquet/Avro 等 官方文档。 连续：Snowpipe（对象存储事件触发微批，serverless 计费） 官方文档。 流式：Snowpipe Streaming（行级直写、秒级延迟，Kafka Connector 默认走此通道…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>批量：<code>COPY INTO</code> 从 Stage（内部/外部 S3/ADLS/GCS）加载，CSV/JSON/Parquet/Avro 等 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>连续：Snowpipe（对象存储事件触发微批，serverless 计费） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>流式：Snowpipe Streaming（行级直写、秒级延迟，Kafka Connector 默认走此通道，支持 schematization 自动建列） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：Snowpipe/Streaming 烧 credit 且不如仓库透明，重度实时摄入的成本需单独 POC 测算；2025-12 高性能 Kafka Connector 进入预览（多 GB/s 目标） <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Batch: COPY INTO from stages (internal / external S3/ADLS/GCS), CSV/JSON/Parquet/Avro official docs. Continuous: Snowpipe (object-storage event-triggered micro-batches, s…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Batch: <code>COPY INTO</code> from stages (internal / external S3/ADLS/GCS), CSV/JSON/Parquet/Avro <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Continuous: Snowpipe (object-storage event-triggered micro-batches, serverless billing) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Streaming: Snowpipe Streaming (row-level direct writes, seconds-level latency; the Kafka Connector&#x27;s default path, with schematization for auto column creation) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: Snowpipe/Streaming burn credits less transparently than warehouses — heavy real-time ingestion needs its own cost POC; a high-performance Kafka Connector entered preview Dec 2025 (multi-GB/s target) <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">ACCOUNT_USAGE 下 ACCESS_HISTORY / QUERY_HISTORY / LOGIN_HISTORY 等视图覆盖&quot;谁、何时、查了什么&quot; 官方文档。 Trust Center 提供内置风险/合规姿态扫描（一等审计信号源） 官方文档。 注意：审计日志由云服务层托管，用户无法自建独立防篡改归档；极端合规场景需评估&quot;既当运…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>ACCOUNT_USAGE 下 ACCESS_HISTORY / QUERY_HISTORY / LOGIN_HISTORY 等视图覆盖&quot;谁、何时、查了什么&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Trust Center 提供内置风险/合规姿态扫描（一等审计信号源） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：审计日志由云服务层托管，用户无法自建独立防篡改归档；极端合规场景需评估&quot;既当运动员又当裁判&quot;的边界 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">ACCOUNT_USAGE views ACCESS_HISTORY / QUERY_HISTORY / LOGIN_HISTORY cover &quot;who, when, queried what&quot; official docs. Trust Center provides built-in risk/compliance posture s…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>ACCOUNT_USAGE views ACCESS_HISTORY / QUERY_HISTORY / LOGIN_HISTORY cover &quot;who, when, queried what&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Trust Center provides built-in risk/compliance posture scanning (a first-party audit signal) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: audit logs are hosted by the cloud services layer; users cannot build an independent tamper-proof archive. Extreme compliance scenarios should evaluate the &quot;player-and-referee&quot; boundary <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（Iceberg 全支持是关键转向）</span><p class=\"snippet\">External Tables：直接读对象存储上的 Parquet/CSV（不搬数据，性能弱于内表） 官方文档。 Iceberg 表：2025-04 宣布全支持（查询性能、数据共享、治理与内表拉齐），支持 Snowflake 托管 catalog 与外部 catalog（Glue/REST/Unity Catalog），2025-10 写…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>External Tables：直接读对象存储上的 Parquet/CSV（不搬数据，性能弱于内表） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Iceberg 表：2025-04 宣布全支持（查询性能、数据共享、治理与内表拉齐），支持 Snowflake 托管 catalog 与外部 catalog（Glue/REST/Unity Catalog），2025-10 写支持 GA <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>意义：Snowflake 从&quot;专有格式围墙&quot;转向开放表格式，跨引擎（Spark/Trino/Flink/DuckDB）读同一份 Iceberg 成为可能；但&quot;全功能&quot;仍以 Snowflake 引擎为中心，外部写与 V3 特性在演进中 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">External Tables: query Parquet/CSV directly on object storage without moving data (weaker performance than internal tables) official docs. Iceberg tables: full support an…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>External Tables: query Parquet/CSV directly on object storage without moving data (weaker performance than internal tables) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Iceberg tables: full support announced April 2025 (query performance, data sharing, governance on par with internal tables), supporting Snowflake-managed and external catalogs (Glue/REST/Unity Catalog); write support GA October 2025 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Significance: Snowflake pivoted from &quot;proprietary-format walls&quot; toward open table formats — cross-engine (Spark/Trino/Flink/DuckDB) reads of the same Iceberg data are now possible. But &quot;full&quot; remains Snowflake-engine-centric; external writes and V3 features are still evolving <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Streams：行级变更捕获（INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE），METADATA$ACTION/METADATA$ISUPDATE/METADATA$ROW_ID，消费即推进 offset；支持表/视图/外部表 官方文档。 Tasks：定时 SQL（cron/间隔），WHEN SYSTEM$STREAM_HAS_DATA 条件触…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Streams：行级变更捕获（INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE），<code>METADATA$ACTION</code>/<code>METADATA$ISUPDATE</code>/<code>METADATA$ROW_ID</code>，消费即推进 offset；支持表/视图/外部表 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Tasks：定时 SQL（cron/间隔），<code>WHEN SYSTEM$STREAM_HAS_DATA</code> 条件触发，支持 DAG（AFTER 依赖），经典 CDC 链路为 Stream→Task→MERGE <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Dynamic Tables：声明式管道（&quot;我要这个查询结果，延迟不超过 X&quot;），<code>TARGET_LAG</code> 控制新鲜度与成本，自动增量刷新，替代手写 Stream+Task 样板 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：Stream 未消费记录在克隆时不继承；Task 调度最小粒度与 serverless 计费细节按版本有差异，POC 实测为准 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Streams: row-level change capture (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE) with METADATA$ACTION/METADATA$ISUPDATE/METADATA$ROW_ID; consuming advances the offset; supported on tables/views/…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Streams: row-level change capture (INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE) with <code>METADATA$ACTION</code>/<code>METADATA$ISUPDATE</code>/<code>METADATA$ROW_ID</code>; consuming advances the offset; supported on tables/views/external tables <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Tasks: scheduled SQL (cron/interval), conditional <code>WHEN SYSTEM$STREAM_HAS_DATA</code>, DAG support via AFTER dependencies — the classic CDC chain is Stream → Task → MERGE <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Dynamic Tables: declarative pipelines (&quot;I want this query&#x27;s results, lag ≤ X&quot;), <code>TARGET_LAG</code> controlling freshness vs cost, automatic incremental refreshes — replacing hand-written Stream+Task boilerplate <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: unconsumed stream records don&#x27;t survive cloning; task scheduling granularity and serverless billing details vary by version — verify in POC <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">DATA_RETENTION_TIME_IN_DAYS 表级保留期，过期自动清理 官方文档。 Time Travel/Fail-safe 是保留期的延伸，不是业务 TTL 语义 官方文档。 保留期产生存储费用，设太长烧钱 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>DATA_RETENTION_TIME_IN_DAYS 表级保留期，过期自动清理 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Time Travel/Fail-safe 是保留期的延伸，不是业务 TTL 语义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>保留期产生存储费用，设太长烧钱 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">DATA_RETENTION_TIME_IN_DAYS per-table retention with automatic cleanup <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Time Travel/Fail-safe extend retention; they are not business TTL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>DATA_RETENTION_TIME_IN_DAYS per-table retention with automatic cleanup <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Time Travel/Fail-safe extend retention; they are not business TTL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Retention consumes storage billing — long periods get expensive <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "snowflake__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（元数据操作在线，无锁表概念）</span><p class=\"snippet\">加列/改列多是元数据操作，在线完成 官方文档。 微分区存储下无传统&#x27;锁表&#x27;概念，并发 DDL 友好 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>加列/改列多是元数据操作，在线完成 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>微分区存储下无传统&#x27;锁表&#x27;概念，并发 DDL 友好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Add/alter column are mostly metadata ops, done online <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Micro-partition storage has no traditional table-lock concept; DDL is concurrency-friendly (communi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Add/alter column are mostly metadata ops, done online <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Micro-partition storage has no traditional table-lock concept; DDL is concurrency-friendly <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});